{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-10-06T10:55:34.240Z","author":"pi-glm","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"pi","agent_model":"grok-4.7","agent_model_source":"environment","agent_instance":"a623801c0e5ff232953db3ad","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"grok-4.7","source":"environment"},"effort":null,"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"argv"},"topic":null},"op":"create","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-rust-poen"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"Legacy list cursors without after_index publish the query fingerprint"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"Published PM CLI 2026.10.5 sets continuation_contract.fingerprint to opaque_cursor when --after decodes but has no after_index. Native list keeps the real query fingerprint. Reproduced on a 75-item fixture: strip after_index from a producer cursor whose after_index is 68, then list --json --after that cursor. Reference continuation_contract.fingerprint is opaque_cursor; native emits the 24-character query fingerprint. The same gap appears with and without --for triage. With after_index present, the envelopes match. This is separate from triage final-page compaction, which must not rebase a missing after_index from zero."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Issue"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":2},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["conformance","read-parity","rust"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-10-06T10:55:34.240Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-10-06T10:55:34.240Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"pi-glm"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"A producer cursor without after_index yields continuation_contract.fingerprint opaque_cursor and byte-identical list envelopes against published PM CLI 2026.10.5, including triage pages; cursors that include after_index stay unchanged."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/parent","value":"pm-rust-u4al"}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"e8ed87f1812af9e329a529e36b644097d4b977716641862cab0a2ef3bb17173d","item_hash_version":3,"message":"","event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"44ff1a491a9cc964c00e439678b56a4274cb4899e3c24dccd0680d380bd122c4"}
{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-10-06T10:58:03.820Z","author":"pi-glm","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"pi","agent_model":"grok-4.7","agent_model_source":"environment","agent_instance":"a623801c0e5ff232953db3ad","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"grok-4.7","source":"environment"},"effort":null,"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-10-06T10:58:03.820Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-10-06T10:58:03.820Z","author":"pi-glm","text":"Repro for the orchestrator: on a 75-item fixture, list --json --limit 69 --output-budget unbounded, decode next_cursor, remove after_index, and re-encode base64url. list --json --after that cursor --output-budget unbounded. Published PM CLI 2026.10.5 sets continuation_contract.fingerprint to opaque_cursor. Native emits the 24-character query fingerprint. The same split appears with --for triage. Cursors that still contain after_index match byte for byte. Do not treat this as the triage rebase bug; that path now requires after_index and omits an over-budget final page."}]}],"before_hash":"e8ed87f1812af9e329a529e36b644097d4b977716641862cab0a2ef3bb17173d","after_hash":"cca2250e9b5197831ed8b01ff444ecf4c49acf3a8096ca06b583cee4dfba18a4","item_hash_version":3,"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"aa5c32262b32d5862a5de57cd59ad7bad12b019863f0edc606819fe4e8f7165d"}
